# A SYN with no options: the SYN-ACK carries MSS and nothing else, because
# window scale, SACK-permitted and timestamps are used only if both SYNs
# offered them.
0      listen 8080
+0     < S 0:0(0) win 65535
+0     > S. 0:0(0) ack 1 win 65535 <mss 1460>
+0.010 < . 1:1(0) ack 1 win 65535
+0     accept
+0     state ESTABLISHED
